extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XRQYGgRVve0Q7kNvwEE5Zwz&_nc_oc=Adqf9b7OtBN1nPrlWV2ezjcobO4-HhSiKMIMlIEN4lK86_Pk6FWi7SdOtRqFhk5njCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOi3dYR7S0Fs2qZBT7BH2VwWF6bbRV7NrFxzArMPD9SoA&oe=6AC7B4D6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sBA98ZZ0uIIQ7kNvwFdvUGV&_nc_oc=AdqFWQGBF1kP4eXW60Sp6_4GxLDU-Xqj6W0jIq5tPIc6sHYHXbw1OjG2kNsf28eu1nk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMRoygg6RZTK7IsNoajleZkCMFontfUNjPm4L3iVfTk0A&oe=6AC7BC22"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CF3O9l1CMrMQ7kNvwGKjG7Y&_nc_oc=Adp4iSRM4EqXCMMO0fyXTDEJ14YRkCKlOOI6EZzR5CHQG0jL7P9DuZvmcAXBjh_k72g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMnby5JNj1-65z6uqLu4FmEt_1ywSQTl6x5V1WfBp0HUg&oe=6AC7C419"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":